1
00:00:00,438 --> 00:00:02,838
(Sheldon:)I don't want
to play anymore.

2
00:00:03,975 --> 00:00:05,545
(Leonard:)We haven't been on a road trip
in a while.

3
00:00:05,545 --> 00:00:06,815
(Leonard:)This is fun.

4
00:00:06,812 --> 00:00:08,282
(Sheldon:)We get it-- you won the game.

5
00:00:08,281 --> 00:00:10,111
(Sheldon:)Stop bragging.

6
00:00:10,116 --> 00:00:12,286
(Leonard:)No, listen, we wrote
a paper together.

7
00:00:12,285 --> 00:00:13,955
(Leonard:)Now we get to go to a university
and talk about it?

8
00:00:13,953 --> 00:00:15,353
(Leonard:)That's pretty cool.

9
00:00:16,321 --> 00:00:18,151
(Sheldon:)I suppose it is.

10
00:00:18,157 --> 00:00:22,657
(Sheldon:)In fact, if you'd like to
celebrate with a little music,

11
00:00:22,662 --> 00:00:24,332
(Sheldon:)I'd be okay with that.

12
00:00:24,330 --> 00:00:27,060
(Leonard:)What...?

13
00:00:28,466 --> 00:00:30,536
(Leonard:)This road trip just got crazy.

14
00:00:31,703 --> 00:00:33,773
(Sheldon:)Play that funky music,
white boy.

15
00:00:35,807 --> 00:00:37,807
(Leonard:)I'm surprised you know
that reference.

16
00:00:37,810 --> 00:00:40,610
(Sheldon:)What reference?

17
00:00:43,748 --> 00:00:46,748
(Bernadette:)So, I put stickers
on everything we're gonna sell.

18
00:00:46,752 --> 00:00:48,682
(Bernadette:)We just need help taking it
all out to the driveway.

19
00:00:48,688 --> 00:00:49,988
(Amy:)Can I be in charge
of pricing?

20
00:00:49,989 --> 00:00:52,559
(Amy:)I've been going to garage
sales my whole life.

21
00:00:52,558 --> 00:00:54,628
(Amy:)Can you believe I got these
pantyhose for a nickel?

22
00:00:56,328 --> 00:01:01,018
(Howard:)All right, Amy's in charge
of pricing and being 75.

